{
  "id": "imessage",
  "slot": "agent-channels",
  "description": "iMessage channel adapter via the BlueBubbles HTTP relay (https://bluebubbles.app). Apple does not expose a server-side iMessage API; BlueBubbles is the standard community workaround that runs on a macOS host you control. receive() polls /api/v1/message/<chatGuid>; send() POSTs to /api/v1/message/text. Honest gap: pure-cloud iMessage is impossible — this layer requires a Mac with BlueBubbles configured.",
